[00:19.14]Three teenagers did some voluntary work during the school holidays.三名青少年在学校假期期间做了一些志愿工作。
[00:24.29]Read their online posts to find out who they helped.nd what they did.阅读他们的网上帖子，了解他们帮助了谁。以及他们做了什么。
[00:30.43]Voluntary work.志愿工作。
[00:33.01]Dong Lili, 39 minutes ago董莉莉，39分钟前
[00:38.20]I saw a notice for voluntary work at the children's hospital, so my best friend and I offered to help.我看到了儿童医院的志愿工作通知，于是我和最好的朋友主动去帮忙。
[00:48.37]The children there all suffer from serious diseases like cancer.那里的孩子都患有癌症等严重疾病。
[00:57.82]We wanted to cheer them up with some fun activities.我们想用一些有趣的活动让他们振作起来。
[01:02.54]For example, we organized a painting competition to raise their spirits.例如，我们组织了绘画比赛来鼓舞他们的情绪。
[01:09.21]I met a girl called Genia.我遇到了一个叫吉尼亚的女孩。
[01:12.42]She wanted to paint a picture of the park near her home.她想画一幅她家附近公园的画。
[01:17.11]However she could not go there herself. 但她自己不能去那里。
[01:21.28]So I went to the park and took some photos. 于是我去公园拍了一些照片.
[01:21.28]Genia used them for her painting.吉尼亚用这些照片来画画。
[01:28.96]Wang Jie, yesterday王杰，昨天
[01:32.65]My mother and I met some children with no parents.我和妈妈遇到了一些没有父母的孩子。
[01:36.93]The children were quiet and unhappy.这些孩子安静又不开心。
[01:40.19]We encourage them to tell stories from their own life.我们鼓励他们讲述自己生活中的故事。
[01:45.22]This helps them express their feelings.这能帮助他们表达自己的感受。
[01:48.32]One child said: My friends don't understand my pain. Sometimes I feel like I don't belong anywhere.一个孩子说：我的朋友不理解我的痛苦，有时候我觉得自己无处可归。
[01:58.41]We spent time with a girl called Liu Yun.我们和一个叫刘云的女孩待在一起。
[02:02.31]Her parents died in a car accident, so she is very lonely.她的父母在车祸中去世，所以她非常孤独。
[02:08.19]She is really unhappy and needs someone to talk to.她很不开心，需要有人倾诉。
[02:13.21]My mother and I will continue to visit Liu Yun in our spare time.我和妈妈会在空闲时间继续看望刘云。
[02:19.15]Ding Ling，Three days ago三天前
[02:23.39]I volunteered to help disabled children.我志愿帮助残疾儿童。
[02:27.08]Some of them have difficulty moving around and taking part in social activities.他们中有些人行动不便，难以参加社交活动。
[02:33.28]I taught them to sing, because music can bring them joy.我教他们唱歌，因为音乐能带给他们快乐。
[02:38.07]I met a boy called Sula.我遇到了一个叫苏拉的男孩。
[02:41.52]He lost his leg in an accident two months ago.他两个月前在一场事故中失去了一条腿。
[02:46.54]Football is his favorite sport, and he was in low spirits because he could not play it anymore.足球是他最喜欢的运动，因为不能再踢了，他情绪很低落。
[02:55.69]We can help children like Sula feel more positive after an accident.我们可以帮助像苏拉这样的孩子在事故后变得更积极。
[03:02.31]I will continue to do voluntary work in the future.我将来会继续做志愿工作。
